/3087/308704/技能1（压缩）.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/技能2（压缩）.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/大招NEW.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/额外.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/额外 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3087/308704/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">她们是大海的女儿，居住在一片远离人烟的石岛之上。<br />每日的时间漫长而寂寥，于是她们唱起了歌。那是万灵所钟的歌喉，每一支歌曲都含有摄人心魄的魅力——这些被人们斥作危险的低吟，足以让每个生灵沉醉其中。但海妖们并不在意这些，她们已见过太多旋律。若你见过一整片海洋的美景，自然不会沉湎于一瓢死水的风光。<br />当维拉闯入海妖的领地时，迎接她的首先是几道好奇的目光——海妖以歌声作为语言。在她们的邀请下，维拉唱起了一支属于来亚什基的歌谣。<br />海妖从来没有听过这样磅礴的歌，胜似风暴中的海浪。当应和者陆续出现的时候，无数声音汇成了合唱。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"308704\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308707.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-308707.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“满斟丰饶”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Brimming with Plenty\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>海底产出的奇珍。它的姐妹们曾经盛满蜂蜜与毒药，装饰过女巫与海神的殿堂，但受访者更乐意用它掬起清冽泉水，将其化为抚平伤痛的良药。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308708.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fc/Belonging-308708.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“静夜的帷幕”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Veil of the Quiet Night\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />20<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条轻盈的织物，受访者称，这是一件塞壬风格的纺织品。<br />她从未想过，自己会在这一时代遇到遥远的血亲们。受访者用画笔记录了相聚的时刻，作为回赠，她得到了一节希腊风格的声乐课，以及这条轻盈如海风的披纱。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308709.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d3/Belonging-308709.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“女巫之手”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Witch's Hand\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>选用白银与贝壳打造的手部饰品，相碰时会发出奇妙的响声。<br />在诸多神话中，受访者的族群都被描述为神奇魔力的拥有者：唱出蛊惑之歌、调制奇妙魔药，或是掀起复仇的巨浪。她不否认某些记载的真实性，但对受访者而言，这双手拥有创造的力量，这才是最重要的。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span cl